### GET all books (default values)
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Search partial title
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=fire

### Sort by price descending
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=price&order=DESC

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=5&offset=5

### Price range filter
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=250&max_price=400

### Combined search, sort, pagination, price range
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=the&order_by=title&order=ASC&limit=5&offset=0&min_price=200&max_price=500

### GET a book by ID (success)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### GET missing book (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/99999

### POST valid book (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "JavaScript Basics",
  "author": "John Smith",
  "price": 400,
  "pages": 300
}

### POST missing title (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "John Smith",
  "price": 400,
  "pages": 300
}

### POST non-numeric price (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "John Smith",
  "price": "four hundred",
  "pages": 300
}

### PUT valid book (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Wings of Fire",
  "author": "A.P.J. Abdul Kalam",
  "price": 300,
  "pages": 200
}

### PUT missing book (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No Such Book",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "price": 100,
  "pages": 50
}

### DELETE book (200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/10

### DELETE missing book (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/99999

### Invalid order value (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order=sideways

### Invalid limit (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=-2
